{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Compute sliding window aggregations, exponentially weighted moving averages, and lagged time-series features."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftDataFrame"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Rolling Windows & Time-Series Transformations"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/RollingWindowsAndTimeSeries","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Financial and sensor time-series require localized window computations to capture trends, momentum, and volatility over time.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"1-Rolling-Moving-Averages--Volatility","text":"1. Rolling Moving Averages & Volatility","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["import SwiftDataFrame","","let priceDF = try DataFrame(columns: [","    TypedColumn<Double>(name: \"price\", values: [100.0, 102.0, 101.5, 105.0, 107.0, 106.5, 110.0])","])","","\/\/ Add a 3-period lagged column for autoregression","let laggedDF = try priceDF.withLaggedColumn(column: \"price\", by: 1, targetColumn: \"price_lag1\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"2. Exponentially Weighted Moving Average (EMA)","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"2-Exponentially-Weighted-Moving-Average-EMA"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$$\\text{EMA}"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t = \\alpha \\cdot x_t + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{EMA}"}]},{"type":"text","text":"{t-1}, \\quad \\alpha = \\frac{2}{N + 1}$$"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accelerated exponential smoothing eliminates high-frequency noise while preserving phase alignment.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/rollingwindowsandtimeseries"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame":{"type":"topic","title":"SwiftDataFrame","url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"High-Performance Columnar Data Tables built on Apache Arrow."}]}}}